# A project chosen in Quick Add stays the destination when another program changes the file while the panel is open.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys qq
type Fix sink /ho
see Home
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Home
outside <<END
Garden:
	- Rake leaves
Work:
	- Write report
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
see Garden:
keys <Enter>
see - Fix sink
quit
saved <<END
Garden:
	- Rake leaves
Work:
	- Write report
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Fix sink
END
